// Lucid, Markdown, Microsoft Office, Zoho), database, disc-image, gauge,
// media-archive, pdf-file, presentation, quip, text, three-d-graphic and
// zip. Redrawn on the 20-unit grid the way the set's others are: a solid
// glyph as fl parts (Slack's region, evenodd or nonzero as its path says,
// nonzero face by face, so a piece wound against the largest ring still
// fills: the Ai's dot, the apple's leaf; inset by half fl's band, flw's
// narrower band where a 0.72 inset would drop a part, or leave a core
