// 1.5-unit walls' centrelines (the medial axis, its junctions and corners
// put back where the walls' lines cross, round loops as circle(), a dot
// as disc()), each wall stroked once: stroking both sides of an inset
// sliver inks every edge twice, 11-43% heavy (icon-shots 45369119745).
